      "notes": "K3 portable none/minimal/medium map to low and xhigh to high; explicit canonical native effort retains precedence. Exact K2.7 models retain enabled service thinking for portable none with a compatibility warning; explicit disabled thinking remains unsupported. Unknown models send none as disabled thinking. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/moonshotai 3.0.78 to 3.0.82. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
